Protocol references

- kind3r/ttlock-sdk-js, https://github.com/kind3r/ttlock-sdk-js
  License: GPL-3.0. Primary reference for the TTLock Bluetooth LE protocol.
  Code ported from it to C++ keeps its GPL-3.0 terms and credits it in the
  ported file.

- roquerodrigo/ttlock-ble, https://github.com/roquerodrigo/ttlock-ble
  License: MIT. Second reference, used to cross-check commands and frames.

Third-party code

- kokke/tiny-AES-c, https://github.com/kokke/tiny-AES-c
  License: public domain (The Unlicense), see
  components/ttlock/src/third_party/aes/unlicense.txt. aes.c, aes.h and
  aes.hpp are vendored unmodified from commit
  23856752fbd139da0b8ca6e471a13d5bcc99a08d and built for AES-128 with CBC
  only (CBC=1, ECB=0, CTR=0).
